==Notes== 
* It is recommended for the player to set their spawn at [[Snow Mountain]] or [[Ice Castle]], as it allows the player to quickly return to the Dark Arena upon death.
* The Dark Arena is one of the few islands that do not have a [[Quest|quest giver]] nor any [[NPCs]] in general.
* The Dark Arena is the only island in the whole game where a [[Portal]] user can directly teleport to, despite the island not having any [[Set Home Point]] [[NPC]], making [[Portal]] [C] the only way to teleport to this island.

