==Trivia==
* The [[Soundtracks|theme]] of the Dark Arena is 'Haunted Halls'—the same [[Soundtracks|theme]] that plays when the player encounters a [[Sea Beast]], triggers a [[Rumbling Waters]] event, or enters [[Treasure Island]] and [[Prehistoric Island]] without being active.

